#: ../../general/Microservices/demo_microservice.rst:417
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "Commands"

#: ../../general/Microservices/demo_microservice.rst:419
msgid ""
":ref:`Команды <ecos_commands>` в Citeck в основном используются для "
"асинхронного обмена сообщениями между приложениями."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Commands<ecos_commands>` in Citeck are mainly used for asynchronous"
" messaging between applications."

#: ../../general/Microservices/demo_microservice.rst:421
msgid "**Command Executor**"
msgstr "**Command Executor**"

#: ../../general/Microservices/demo_microservice.rst:423
